// The one program shape the new back end still refuses with L0001 that a
// probe can reach without C (Stage 28 W8b): `break` (or `next`) inside a
// lambda body, which the checker accepts when a `while` encloses the
// lambda (mir.md W7b.9, defect 6, a front-end follow-up: the old back end
// fails on it in myc). tests/cases/test_scalars.av checks the diagnostic
// and its location. No `fn main`, so the differential leaves it out.
// (Until W8b the probe was examples/spawn.av, which W8b lowers.)

fn run: Int {
  i = 0
  while i < 3 {
    f: fn(): Int = { ||
      break
      1
    }
    i = i + f()
  }
  i
}
